## 7. Reporting

7.1 HPL provides each customer with a monthly performance scorecard by the 5th business day of the following month, showing every metric in Section 3, the shipments excluded under Section 5 and any credit due.

7.2 Customers may request shipment-level detail for any metric. Disputes about the scorecard must be raised within 30 days of its delivery.

## 8. Review

HPL and the customer review service levels and targets at least once a year, or earlier if the customer's volume or service profile changes significantly.
